WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.442
A fixed base, rigid arm, and payload. A drawing does not reveal command delay.

00:00:04.442 --> 00:00:08.884
q_des enters the fixed PD controller. The buffer stores the full torque command c.

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:13.325
Delay is after PD; the delayed torque drives the gravity-loaded pendulum.

00:00:13.325 --> 00:00:17.767
This is an effective command delay at this boundary, not an electromagnetic motor time constant.
